   "verdict": "no match: inspected the returned types and Mathlib/CategoryTheory/Functor/Hom.lean:24-31, AlgebraicTopology/SimplicialCategory/Basic.lean:43-70, SimplicialNerve.lean:24-34,193-210. Ordinary hom pairings and Hom functors of an already enriched ordinary category do not construct the coherent Hom comparison for arbitrary quasicategories. Internal-Hom quasicategory instances only provide closure of functor objects; coherent space category and straightening are not supplied."
